<p class="MsoNormal">Congratulations!<br><br>Now that your cash has been deposited into your account, we want to thank you for choosing National Funding.&nbsp; We are pleased to help you get the cash you need for your business.&nbsp; Since 1999, we've helped thousands of businesses like yours get the funding they need when others couldn't help, and the reason we've been successful is because we try to provide the service you need.&nbsp; I hope we can do business again in the future, so feel free to call me with future needs for financing.<br><br>Perhaps you would be willing to tell others about your experience and how we were able to help you get working capital.&nbsp; You can review your experience with National Funding on the Better Business Bureau (BBB) website. Please <a href="http://www.nationalfunding.com/r/bbb-redirect/?utm_source=bbb&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term={!Opportunity.Name}&amp;utm_content={!Opportunity.OwnerFullName}&amp;utm_campaign=bbb%2Breview"><font color="#FF0000">click this link</font></a> and follow the BBB’s directions.&nbsp; We thank you in advance, and believe your insight on the process will be invaluable for other business owners to understand National Funding and the lending process better.&nbsp; In addition, I have provided links to our social media accounts, including Facebook, so if you want to comment on your experience, we’d like to hear from you!&nbsp; You can also stay connected with us on Twitter, LinkedIn, and Google+.<br><br>Thank you and good luck!<br><br>{!Opportunity.OwnerFullName}<br><b>National Funding</b><br>Phone: {!Opportunity.OwnerPhone}<br>Email:&nbsp; {!Opportunity.OwnerEmail}<br><br><font color="#CC0000" size="1">Follow Us on: </font><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/national.funding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNEu&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a><a href="http://www.linkedin.com/company/national-funding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNFn&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a><a href="https://twitter.com/NatFunding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNFx&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a><a title="Google+" href="https://plus.google.com/+Nationalfunding/" target="_blank" alt="Google+"><img src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001Xf1W&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5&amp;lastMod=1363900191000"></a></p><br><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 7.5pt; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);"><font color="#666666" face="arial, sans-serif" size="1"><font color="#666666" face="arial, sans-serif" size="1"><span style="font-size: 7.5pt; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);"><font color="#666666" face="arial, sans-serif" size="1"><font color="#666666" face="arial, sans-serif" size="1"><span style="font-size: 7.5pt; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);"><font color="#666666" face="arial, sans-serif" size="1"><font color="#666666" face="arial, sans-serif" size="1"><font color="#666666" face="arial, sans-serif" size="1">If you no longer
 wish to receive emails from National Fu<font size="1">nding</font>, send an email to 
emailreply@national<font size="1">funding</font>.com with Unsubscribe in the subject line. 
You may also unsubscribe by sending written notice to: National Funding Unsubscribe, 9530 <font size="1">Towne<font size="1"> Centre Dr.</font></font>, Suite 120, San 
Diego, CA 9212<font size="1">1</font>. Thank you. </font></font></font></span></font></font></span><br><font size="1">National Funding</font> respects your privacy. Our commitment to your privacy is  
described in our Privacy Policy which is available on our Web site for  
your reference.          <br>          © 2016&nbsp;<font size="1">National Funding. &nbsp;All Rights Reserved.</font></font></font></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
